---
layout: layouts/base.njk
htmlLang: en
ogLocale: en_US
title: Repertoire for Your Event — Luxury Cover Band
description: "Explore a published selection of 420 song entries, search by artist or title, and discuss your event set list with Luxury Cover Band."
keywords: "cover band repertoire, song list, Luxury Cover Band repertoire, PDF repertoire"
permalink: /en/repertoire/
---

<section class="page-hero page-hero--list">
	<div class="container container--narrow">
		<p class="page-hero__breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/en/' | url }}">{{ site.shortName }}</a> <span>·</span><span>Repertoire</span></p>
		<p class="page-hero__eyebrow">Repertoire</p>
		<h1 class="page-hero__title">Our repertoire.<br><span class="muted">From jazz to hits.</span></h1>
		<p class="page-hero__lead">Pop, rock, jazz, soul, funk, retro, Italian, French, Spanish, English and custom mashup versions.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light">
	<div class="container reveal">
		<div class="repertoire">
			<div class="repertoire__text">
				<p class="section__lead">Search the published selection of 420 entries below. Some songs appear in more than one category; this is not the band's complete repertoire. Ask us about any song you cannot find.</p>
				<div class="repertoire__cta">
					<a class="btn btn--dark" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">Discuss your song choices</a>
					<a class="btn btn--ghost-dark" href="{{ '/en/repertoire/catalog/#print' | url }}">Print / Save as PDF</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="repertoire__badges">
				{% for tag in ['Pop','Rock','Jazz','Soul','Funk','Retro','Italiano','Francais','Espanol','English','Russian','Chanson','Caucasus','Instrumental','Mashup','Remix'] %}
				<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>
				{% endfor %}
			</div>
		</div>
		<iframe src="{{ '/en/repertoire/catalog/?view=embedded' | url }}" title="Search the Luxury Cover Band song selection" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;height:800px;border:0;margin-top:32px;"></iframe>
	</div>
</section>
